msgid "Spray captan 50% wettable powder (50 WP) at 2.5 grams per litre of water or mancozeb 75% wettable powder (75 WP) at 2.5 grams per litre of water from green-tip stage at 10-14 day intervals in wet weather. Rake and destroy fallen leaves."
msgstr "सिदोब बोथोराव गोथां-गोनां थाखोनिफ्राय 10-14 साननि गेजेरजों मोनफ्रोम लितार दैयाव 2.5 ग्रामनि थाखाय केपतेन 50% सिदोबनाय पाउदार (50 WP) एबा मोनफ्रोम लितार दैयाव 2.5 ग्रामनि थाखाय मेन्कजेब 75% सिदोबनाय पाउदार (75 WP) सार। सिरिनानै गोग्लैनाय बिलाइफोरखौ फोजोबस्रां।"

msgid "Spray mancozeb 75% wettable powder (75 WP) at 2.5 grams per litre of water or chlorothalonil at 2 grams per litre of water at 10-day intervals from first symptoms; remove lower infected leaves and rotate crops."
msgstr "गिबिसिन लैखोनफोरनिफ्राय 10 साननि फाराग-खालामनायाव मोनफ्रोम लितार दैयाव 2.5 ग्रामआव मेनकजेब 75% गिसि-जाथाव गुन्दै (75 WP) एबा मोनफ्रोम लितार दैयाव 2 ग्रामआव क्ल’र’थालनिलखौ सार। गाहाय सनदेरनाय बिलाइफोरखौ बोखार आरो फसलफोरखौ सोलाय-सोल’ खालाम।"

msgid "Spray mancozeb 75% wettable powder (75 WP) at 2.5 grams per litre of water preventively; at first symptoms use cymoxanil + mancozeb at 3 grams per litre of water or metalaxyl + mancozeb at 2.5 grams per litre of water. Destroy infected plants."
msgstr "2.5 g/L आव होबथानायनि थाखाय mancozeb 75% सिदोब खालामथाव गुन्दै (75 WP) सार। गिबि लैखोनफोराव cymoxanil + mancozeb आव 3 g/L एबा metalaxyl + mancozeb आव 2.5 g/L बाहाय। सनदेरजानाय बिफांफोरखौ फोजोबस्रां।"

msgid "Spray mancozeb at 2.5 grams per litre of water or copper oxychloride 50% wettable powder (50 WP) at 3 grams per litre of water; remove infected leaves."
msgstr "मोनफ्रोम लितार दैयाव 2.5 ग्रामनि मोनकजेब एबा मोनफ्रोम लिताराव 3 ग्रामनि कपार अक्सिक्लरइद 50% गिसि जाथाव गुन्दै (50 WP) सार।"

msgid "Spray water on leaf undersides, use neem oil at 5 ml per litre of water; if severe use a recommended acaricide such as spiromesifen 22.9% suspension concentrate (22.9 SC) at 0.8 ml per litre of water as per label."
